        "deposit.opex.desc_2_2": ', then select "OPX", "Buy". Next enter the mobile phone number where the crypto check will be sent to via SMS. Next fill out personal data (required only once). Then insert banknotes and press "Pay".',
        "deposit.opex.text_1": "You can make deposits and withdraw cash using Opex cryptocurrency without commission! Exchange rate 1 OPX = 1 national currency<br/>There are two ways to purchase and sell Opex:",
        "deposit.opex.text_2": '<b>1. "Unipay" cash desks</b><br/><b>Buy Opex</b><br/>Pass the cashier desired amount and tell your mobile phone number where the Opex check number will be sent via SMS.  Then enter the check number on the site in the "Deposit" section.<br/><b>Cash out Opex</b><br/>Create a withdrawal request on the site in the \u201cWithdraw\u201d section. Enter the mobile phone number where the Opex check number will be sent via SMS. Next, enter the amount and password of the trading account. At the cash desk present your ID to the cashier and tell the check number from the SMS.',
