        "footer.text_2": "<p>The site hosted at the buleto.com domain belongs to and is managed by Binolux Ltd., registered at: Suite 305, Griffith Corporate Centre, P.O. Box 1510, Beachmont, Kingstown, St. Vincent and the Grenadines. The agent is Tradeford; registration No. 12076073, registered at: Suite 23057 8 Shepherd Market, Mayfair, London W1J 7JY, United Kingdom.</p>",
